C --> CFR001 : View financial insights dashboard  
SA --> SAFR002 : Manage AML alerts  
FA --> FAFR005 : Schedule client sessions  

SFR013 <|-- (Client) : Generates alerts based on conditions  
CFR004 <|-- (Client) : Receives recommendations  

CFR006 <|-- (Client) : View spending limit alerts  
SAFR002 <|-- (SystemAdministrator) : Manages AML parameters  
FA --> FAFR007 : Views portfolio diversification opportunities  

SFR013 <|-- (FinancialAdvisor) : Generates client-specific alerts  
CFR009 <|-- (Client) : Accesses consolidated dashboard  
SA --> SAFR004 : Configures analysis parameters for segments  

AIFR002 <|-- (Client, FinancialAdvisor) : Provides personalized recommendations  
SFR017 <|-- (Client) : Generates financial health reports  

' Relationships between actors and use cases
